                                "sense_id": "a6cbfada-44c8-3c6b-b794-b7f0c22f4da4",
                                "text": "[Of course $20,000 is too much.] Only a cheap chiseler would ask that much."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a92479c-3ab1-35d4-a9f6-21e3c13a7fda",
